<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 2</h3>Tier 8 shoulders are a great early pick up as they are one of two T8 set pieces that have haste instead of crit. The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46068/amice-of-inconceivable-horror">
