<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 2</h3>Best in slot is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45618/sunglimmer-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Cloak</span></a>. This item is a result of <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=13819/heroic-all-is-well-that-ends-well">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic: All Is Well That Ends Well</span></a>, much like the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44577/heroic-key-to-the-focusing-iris">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_mindsooth.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Key to the Focusing Iris</span></a> quest in Phase 1. Less than half of a static 25M roster will get this before the phase is over. If you don't think it's realistic to expect receiving this drop, consider the 10M version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46321/sunglimmer-drape">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Drape</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45541/shroud-of-alteration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Alteration</span></a> from trash.<br/>
<br/>Because of the challenges acquiring haste in Phase 2, the haste cloak enchant is recommended. If you find yourself over the haste cap, swapping in the spell power enchant is optimal. Lightweave averages higher, but it is too unreliable to recommend as a healing enchant.<br/>
<br/>
