<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 2</h3>This slot is one where you should take raw BiS instead of your T8 set piece. It's the greatest gain of stats between all the tier slots. If you happen to get a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45634/breastplate-of-the-wayward-vanquisher">
