<br/>The Boomkin T8 chest has better raw stats than Resto T8 chest, but it is not recommended to get the chest token for this reason as it is so contested. Consider picking this up with badges if you already have your T8 4pc, dont have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45519/vestments-of-the-blind-denizen">
