<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 2</h3>Bis for the glove slot is one of the unfortunate crit focused tier pieces <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46183/conquerors-nightsong-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Nightsong Handguards</span></a>. You can consider the other options if you have your 4pc T8 in the other slots, or are going for a tier-less setup. All of the good glove options are out of 25M Ulduar. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40460/valorous-dreamwalker-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Dreamwalker Handguards</span></a> are better than any 10M Ulduar options.<br/>
<br/>For enchants, the haste from hyperspeed accelerators will end up being waste a majority of the time. Since we strive to approach our haste cap, the extra haste will not benefit our casting speed as much as other classes. If you find yourself exceptionally low on haste, or want to spam <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48443/regrowth">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_resistnature.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regrowth</span></a> at 1s cast time, you could consider Hyperspeed Accelerators.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44592/enchant-gloves-exceptional-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Exceptional Spellpower</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a> (Engineering)<div class="pad"></div>
