<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 2</h3>The most important trinket to get is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45703/spark-of-hope">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_invisibilitytotem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spark of Hope</span></a>. The MP5 returns from this trinket are so powerful that it allows for heavier throughput itemization in other slots. Luckily it drops on <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32930/kologarn">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kologarn</span></a> (10), so it should be an easy pick up. The BiS trinket for your second slot will be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_improvedresistanceauras.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Show of Faith</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>As you progress through Ulduar and start to farm the instance, you will use 3 different trinket combinations for different scenarios: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45703/spark-of-hope">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_invisibilitytotem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spark of Hope</span></a> + <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_improvedresistanceauras.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Show of Faith</span></a> for long fights, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45703/spark-of-hope">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_invisibilitytotem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spark of Hope</span></a> + <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_hyjal_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illustration of the Dragon Soul</span></a> for average fights, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_improvedresistanceauras.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Show of Faith</span></a> + <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_hyjal_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illustration of the Dragon Soul</span></a> for quick fights.<br/>
<br/>If you feel you need more regen in a pinch during progression, consider swapping in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=19288/darkmoon-card-blue-dragon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ticket_tarot_bluedragon_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Blue Dragon</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40430/majestic-dragon-figurine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_head_dragon_green.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Majestic Dragon Figurine</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
